12584,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3MDEyNTg0","user":{"login":"creocoder","id":896494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NjQ5NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/896494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder","html_url":"https://github.com/creocoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-03-03T19:10:44Z","updated_at":"2015-03-03T19:10:44Z","body":"@mikehaertl Have you read link? :)\n\nGiven a version number MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, increment the:\n1. MAJOR version when you make incompatible API changes,\n2. MINOR version when you add functionality in a backwards-compatible manner, and,\n3. PATCH version when you make backwards-compatible bug fixes.\n\nWhen new features added by following SemVer you should raise MINOR version. That means that we should have: 2.1.0, 2.2.0, 2.3.0 already. Patch versions used only for patches. Usually it work next way: master and develop branches. You merge develop with master only when you plan raise MINOR version. Patches very useful for force major situations like that to make new fw version available ASAP. If short Yii use PATCH section for MINOR purposes. So Yii not follow SemVer at all :) There is many examples of projects which trully follow SemVer (look at something start from L char :) ). Following SemVer give significant advantages. \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/77012584/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"creocoder","id":896494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NjQ5NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/896494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder","html_url":"https://github.com/creocoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/creocoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":245446342,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjQ1NDQ2MzQy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/245446342","actor":{"login":"mikehaertl","id":675062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NTA2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/675062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikehaertl","html_url":"https://github.com/mikehaertl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikehaertl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikehaertl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikehaertl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikehaertl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikehaertl/s